"2026-07-30T09:54:00.543974+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:55:00.680004+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"f439388c-ffb7-4590-ab32-3dd398750342","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"数据接收与帧重组","description":"数据接收与帧重组","prompt":"第 1 层（数据接收层）：讲解 UDPReceiver 经数据口 4098 接收 DCA1000 的 LVDS 数据流(三种接收模式、包结构 seqNum+byteCnt+payload)、UnlockQueue 无锁环形队列缓冲，以及基于 seqNum 的跨帧重组算法(SortPackets)；以 net_compat.h 跨平台 socket 层为基础。此为纯数据通路，不含设备控制命令。","parent_id":"d83111d8-fa64-4c63-b8cb-32b52bff8138","progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.545576+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:57:18.764703+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:","layer_level":1},{"id":"8839d613-14e7-4dd8-8f7f-81c392333965","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"DCA1000 命令控制","description":"DCA1000 命令控制","prompt":"描述 UDPController 通过命令口 4096 向 DCA1000 发送控制命令的协议(5aa5 header + cmd + length + body + aaee footer)、CommandCode 命令集(复位/配置/启停录制等)与收发/超时处理，底层依赖 net_compat.h 跨平台 socket。","parent_id":"add815d5-9720-4a01-815a-b4f7a7517877","progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.54606+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:57:26.502273+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:","layer_level":1},{"id":"4a2dadb5-a1c0-4fba-abfb-c582e4096eff","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"构建系统与运行入口","description":"构建系统与运行入口","prompt":"解析 CMakeLists.txt 的跨平台配置、test_udp 与 radar_full 两个构建目标的源文件组成与用途，以及主程序 #if 0(实时采集)/#if 1(离线解析) 两种运行模式。","order":1,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.54523+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:54:48.272761+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"8e6b3049-e509-44e0-bd7e-875e407b5d9d","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"雷达数据解析","description":"雷达数据解析","prompt":"第 2 层（解析层）：说明 DataParser 如何把数据接收层交付的原始 ADC 字节流解析为复数 I/Q，含单天线(parse_FrameData)与全天线(parse_FrameData_AllRX)两种输出、I/Q 交织格式(每 2 sample 占 4 int16)与 RadarParams 参数、expectSize_ 校验。","parent_id":"d83111d8-fa64-4c63-b8cb-32b52bff8138","order":1,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.54584+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:57:58.978439+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:","layer_level":1},{"id":"5d8a9652-f33f-44e5-9895-1801dba0278a","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"串口通信与 AWR1843 雷达控制","description":"串口通信与 AWR1843 雷达控制","prompt":"梳理串口栈：SerialPort 抽象基类 → WzSerialPortAdapter 适配器 → WzSerialportPlus 底层驱动；以及 AWR1843Controller 的双串口设计(CLI/数据)、cfg 配置下发、参数计算与 TLV 帧(parseData18xx)解析。","parent_id":"add815d5-9720-4a01-815a-b4f7a7517877","order":1,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.546164+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:58:10.192516+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:","layer_level":1},{"id":"d83111d8-fa64-4c63-b8cb-32b52bff8138","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"网络数据链路与解析","description":"网络数据链路与解析","prompt":"统领从数据接收到解析的两层结构：下层数据接收与帧重组负责跨平台 socket 收取 LVDS 数据流并按 seqNum 还原成帧，上层雷达数据解析把原始字节还原为复数 I/Q。给出两层的职责边界与自下而上的数据流协作关系。本链路只含数据通路，DCA1000 命令控制归入设备控制章节。","order":2,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.545441+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:54:37.643959+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"add815d5-9720-4a01-815a-b4f7a7517877","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"雷达与 DCA1000 设备控制","description":"雷达与 DCA1000 设备控制","prompt":"设备控制章节总览：把针对 DCA1000 的 UDP 命令控制与针对 AWR1843 的串口控制归为同一'配置/启停设备'语义域，说明两条控制通道(命令口4096 / 串口)的职责、共性与区别，并与数据接收通路(数据口4098)明确区分。","order":3,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.54596+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:55:36.642973+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"28598a7a-9400-4ce2-a3dd-140f911bfa75","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"跨平台兼容性设计","description":"跨平台兼容性设计","prompt":"解释 net_compat.h 如何将 winsock2 与 BSD socket 差异收口(SOCKET 类型统一、net_* 辅助函数)，以及串口层 Win32(DCB/ReadFile) 与 POSIX(termios/read) 的双实现与 SO_RCVTIMEO 差异处理。","order":4,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.546289+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:55:34.661101+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"531cf3df-aa90-4a4d-8837-e89f4788ec54","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"日志系统","description":"日志系统","prompt":"分析 Logger.h 的多线程安全日志：单例 Logger、观察者模式的 LogSink(ConsoleSink/FileSink)、LogQueue 生产者-消费者异步写出，以及 {} 占位符变参模板格式化与日志级别。","order":5,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.546418+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:55:59.620149+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"160e0dbe-8e96-4a26-9843-a8a52a8133c8","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"实时处理流水线与数据流","description":"实时处理流水线与数据流","prompt":"描述 RealTimeDataProcessor 如何串联 UDPReceiver 与 DataParser，批量(FRAME_BATCH_SIZE)累积后落盘(解析后复数 / 原始 ADC 两种写盘模式)，并给出实时采集端到端数据流时序。","order":6,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.546518+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:56:26.647726+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"7361b9cf-1822-41e3-b302-deedaa37107b","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"数据处理流程扩展开发指南","description":"数据处理流程扩展开发指南","prompt":"面向二次开发：说明后续新增的数据处理流程(如 Range-FFT/Doppler-FFT/CFAR/点云检测)如何接入现有流水线。明确规范接入点：实时链路在 RealTimeDataProcessor::ProcessingLoop 中 parse_FrameData 成功产出复数帧之后插入新处理级，离线链路在 main(#if 1) 的 parse 之后；级间数据契约统一用 DataParser 输出类型 FrameDataSingleRx/FrameDataAllRx；并给出配置(RadarParams)、批量落盘(WriteParsedFramesToFile 模式)、日志(Logger)、线程与锁(bufferMutex/fileMutex)等配套约定，以及新增一个算法级的步骤与注意事项。","order":7,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.546633+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:56:40.495485+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"1565e96d-9b88-49d0-bf24-64b4f191b76e","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","name":"雷达与采集参数配置文件","description":"雷达与采集参数配置文件","prompt":"讲解 1T1R.cfg / awr1843.cfg 的 mmWave CLI 命令(dfeDataOutputMode/channelCfg/profileCfg/chirpCfg/frameCfg/sensorStart 等)含义与关键字段，说明 AWR1843Controller 如何读取下发并由 profileCfg/frameCfg/channelCfg 推导距离分辨率、多普勒分辨率、最大距离/速度等雷达参数；并解释 cf.json 中 DCA1000 的 LVDS/以太网流/dataFormatMode/packetDelay 等采集配置。","order":8,"progress_status":"completed","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:00.55136+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:57:04.630955+08:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"}],"wiki_items":[{"catalog_id":"d83111d8-fa64-4c63-b8cb-32b52bff8138","title":"网络数据链路与解析","description":"网络数据链路与解析","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","reference_count":0,"id":"b82c33d4-1d8a-4858-a322-dafe553615a6","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:37.641834+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:54:37.644097+08:00"},{"catalog_id":"4a2dadb5-a1c0-4fba-abfb-c582e4096eff","title":"构建系统与运行入口","description":"构建系统与运行入口","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","reference_count":0,"id":"87196176-3622-41db-b4ce-4a3259a17e31","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:54:48.270538+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:54:48.272885+08:00"},{"catalog_id":"6776b12e-22ba-4bbf-bdb1-4c14bbec0040","title":"项目概述与整体架构","description":"项目概述与整体架构","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","reference_count":0,"id":"fa5b324f-34c2-413a-b022-954d255fb6a1","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:55:00.677264+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:55:00.680153+08:00"},{"catalog_id":"28598a7a-9400-4ce2-a3dd-140f911bfa75","title":"跨平台兼容性设计","description":"跨平台兼容性设计","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","reference_count":0,"id":"e53dc70e-e562-4013-b34f-3d3172f78672","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:55:34.657378+08:00","gmt_modified":"2026-07-30T09:55:34.66198+08:00"},{"catalog_id":"add815d5-9720-4a01-815a-b4f7a7517877","title":"雷达与 DCA1000 设备控制","description":"雷达与 DCA1000 设备控制","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"c3a805e5-6b77-4110-a57c-b3e3bf79813c","reference_count":0,"id":"8d98a997-0e2e-4a15-a101-00a10b1fbab0","gmt_create":"2026-07-30T09:55:36.640763+08:00","gm